# LMS Logic & Permissions Upgrade Plan

This plan outlines the technical changes to restrict Admin role creation, expand Principal and Teacher management capabilities, implement a marking system, and fix the universal report's print alignment.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Admin Restriction**: Admins will no longer be able to create other Admins. Only the initial system setup or manual database intervention will allow new Admin creation.
> - **Teacher-Led Result Submission**: Teachers will now have a dedicated interface to enter marks for their entire class at once. These results will be instantly visible to the Principal.
> - **Shared Management**: Management of students and classes will now be shared between Admin, Principal, and (for students) Teachers.

